   165	  ↓ 6 Write to the library (Code): Resolve extraction's group associations to final theses and save them in this step. Each subject has its own writing queue; write theme theses before asset theses. Save new theses with their dependency edges. A repeat adds a source reference and any new thesis link. For replacement, order by when the statement was made: later statements supersede earlier ones. A late-arriving older statement is logged, not inserted. Carry the old evidence's other thesis links to its replacement. An original-source revision that omits a statement without replacing it marks it replaced. If compared data changes before writing, repeat matching only for the affected part.
